# quads.rkt, world.rkt, sugar-list.rkt and utils.rkt (merged to keep the configuration count
# down; see NOTES.md). Functions taking (U QuadAttrs HashableList) have one variant per case:
# a HashableList (an IValList of keys and values) is converted with make-quadattrs.

# ---- world.rkt ----

